{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/76846-can-demons-spend-aether-to-boost-attributes","id":76846,"title":"Can Demons spend Aether to boost attributes?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-21T21:19:13-08:00","id":76846,"title":"Can Demons spend Aether to boost attributes?","content":"&quot;Demons use Aether to fuel their Exploits, to access their<br /> Cover\u2019s various countermeasures (such as spoofing and Legend,<br /> see p. 112), <b>and to enhance their own physical capabilities.</b>.&quot;<br /> <br /> Can anybody direct me to what the bolded text is referencing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T21:28:35-08:00","id":76849,"title":"","content":"I'm guessing you're referencing the Kickstarter preview version, because that section in my current copy just reads:<br /> <br /> &quot;Demons use Aether to fuel their Exploits and access their Cover\u2019s various countermeasures (such as spoofing and Legend, see p. 112).&quot;<br /> <br /> I do wonder how much might be needed to make a basic &quot;boost [Attribute(s)] by spending Aether&quot; Interlock sufficiently interesting, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T17:23:00-08:00","id":77415,"title":"","content":"If there was a kind of physical capacity boost ability, would it be a demonic form power, and embed or an exploit?<br /> <br /> If memory serves, I think the only instance of a stat manipulting ability is the Body Modification demonic form power and that one doesn't require aether. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","name":"Rixx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T21:28:47-08:00","id":77464,"title":"","content":"Well one way to (sort of) boost attributes with aether is... well... you could activate partial transformation and activate Inhuman Strength or such...<br /> <br /> I know. I know. But it is the first thing that came to me when I read that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T11:46:35-08:00","id":77760,"titl